# Session start — agent memory

When continuing work in this workspace:

1. Read `{{MEMORY_HOME}}/chats/projects/{{WORKSPACE_SLUG}}.md` — **## Open threads** first.
2. Pick the thread matching the task at hand and follow it.
3. If a thread is vague or marked `[auto]` — drill the `[title](uuid)` link in **## Recent** (transcript tail only, not full jsonl).
4. For architecture, proposing plans, or cross-project rules — invoke `@agent-memory` or read INSTRUCTIONS Flow E.

